<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2006 stock.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2006 stock.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said on Wednesday it will offer A$100 million of 10.25 percent November 2006 stock at today's tender.</p>
<p>The tender is scheduled for 10.30 a.m. local time (2330 GMT) and the result should be known shortly afterwards.</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
